# ===================== SITL exceptions to real values (documented) =====================
# EKF source set 3 is a manual backup set (selected only by an RC switch) whose height source
# is the rangefinder. Simulating that rangefinder broke Gazebo lock-step (Gate 1 run 3), so
# set 3 uses the barometer here. Source set 1 (the one used in flight) is unchanged.
